      "message": "fix(bore): refuse an arc entry at the command doors; pin the Entry group\n\nMove the Bore entry allow-list (plunge, ramp, helix) into\nOpParams::bore_entry_refusal so CreateOperation, EditOperationParams and\npaste refuse arc by name through named_refusal. The generator keeps the\nsame check as a second check. Add structural tests for the Entry group:\nthe three types, the fields of each, and Apply with undo and redo.\n\nRefs #3828\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
